	quest.676D37ACF0954BE7.title: "Welcome to the Realm of Aetheris"
	quest.701EC3F75E7AF12A.quest_desc: [
		"Minecraft In-Game Rules"
		"• Spawn"
		"Spawn is a safe haven(No PvP) and you are free to set up shop/home there. Do not destroy other players’ shops or builds at spawn."
		""
		"• No cheating/Exploiting"
		"This includes X-ray, hacking of any kind, exploiting bugs or client-side mods for unfair PvP advantages and massive resource grinding."
		""
		"• Create"
		"Making a machine that is designed to lag the server or kill the server will result in an immediate ban or temp ban (depending on the level of severity)."
		""
		"• No Spawn killing"
		"That includes similar techniques such as camping corpses, beds or trapping portals. When you kill someone do the honorable thing and wait for them to return to discuss items you've won from them."
		""
		"• Claims"
		"No terrain griefing (wasting the natural resources or breaking lootr chests without permission). Slight terrain griefing is tolerated for some context such as war."
		""
		"• Land Claims"
		"Don't claim boss structures, if you join a team you will need to work together as a team to use your claims wisely."
		""
		"• Nicknames"
		"Please keep nicknames appropriate and don't use them to impersonate another player or a real-life person."
		""
		"• Claim Banning"
		"If you do not want a player in your claims then text it in chat that they are now claim banned from your claims and they are not allowed in your claims after that. If they return you have full right to kill them on sight or contact a staff member. If you are claim banned you must stay 3 chunks away from their claims."
	]
	quest.701EC3F75E7AF12A.title: "Rules"
